title: "A meta-methods review of methodological flexibility in the Iowa Gambling Task"
abstract: "Data and code accompanying our study on methodological flexibility in the use of the Iowa Gambling Task, including the meta-methods review, a scoring multiverse analysis, the sampling process, and inter-rater reliability."
